Third-party model licenses

Nigiri ships no model weights. Models are downloaded on first run from their
authors' Hugging Face repositories and remain under their own licenses, which
you should review before use:

  * Whisper.cpp GGUF models (ggerganov/whisper.cpp)        - MIT
  * HY-MT1.5 translation models (Tencent)                  - Tencent HY License
  * Supertonic 3 TTS (Supertone)                           - OpenRAIL-M (model),
                                                             MIT (sample code)
  * Qwen3-TTS (Alibaba Qwen)                               - Apache-2.0

llama.cpp and whisper.cpp (the runtimes Nigiri downloads into ./bin) are both
MIT licensed.
